flowchart TD
 A[Connected: rotate every 4h, valid 8h] --> B[Stopped: no rotation]
 B --> C[Authorized start and provider reconciliation]
 C -->|Valid and eligible| D[Authenticate and renew when due]
 C -->|Expired, known and eligible| E[Fresh provider-delivered one-use enrollment]
 C -->|Revoked / unknown / mismatched| X[Deny automatic recovery]
 E --> F[Generate new key; prove possession]
 F --> G[Consume grant; issue recorded identity]
 G --> D
 R[Running but expired] --> S[Validated host channel or authorized restart]
 S --> E
